Cell["\<\
The path of two edges has two matches, so the second step adds two states, \
each a path of three edges. Each of those has three matches, so the third \
step adds six:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1002769646,ExpressionUUID->"4d620fc7-5cf2-d9d8-7b11-a6a15484ab22"],

