}], "Text",
 CellID->5047578,ExpressionUUID->"36c19c85-764d-0b01-5efe-15ef03f8566b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "State and event ids are assigned in the order the engine creates them, \
which can differ between two evolutions of the same input. To use the ids of \
states and events together, get both from one evolution with the property ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<States\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Events\>\""}], "}"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6815cd54-0cd7-196f-182a-e51ea5626bb5"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellID->15008895,ExpressionUUID->"519775d4-d545-25f2-07ad-6c91dcf18fd8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "With a list of rules, ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RuleIndex\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5900aac7-5263-773e-0f3f-43a167165a04"],
 " separates the events of each rule. Two rules that extend an edge by one or \
by two new edges, applied to two loops at vertex 1, fire twice each in the \
first step:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1892712309,ExpressionUUID->"06ecfdb3-2197-c9b0-2e93-f4fd50239b9a"],

