Cell["\<\
The vertices of a rule may be symbols. The chain rule written with symbols \
reaches the same ten states:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->941376513,ExpressionUUID->"6121b9de-dddd-aca8-10de-309bd469f6f2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

