Cell["\<\
The number of states grows with the number of histories. For the chain rule, \
the number of states at steps 0 to 5:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1820947576,ExpressionUUID->"3119d855-3ffd-7401-6726-d21fb9885f6b"],

